      ],
      "steps": [
        "Season the beef strips with the salt and pepper and sear in batches in olive oil over high heat until browned. Set aside.",
        "In the same pan, cook the sliced brown onions and garlic until softened.",
        "Add the mushrooms and cook until they release their liquid and start to brown, 5-6 minutes.",
        "Stir in the paprika and mustard, cook for 1 minute.",
        "Pour in the broth and Worcestershire sauce and simmer 3-4 minutes to reduce slightly.",
        "Stir in the cooking cream and bring to a gentle simmer.",
        "Return the beef to the pan and simmer 5-8 minutes until the sauce thickens and the beef is tender.",
        "Finish with sliced green onions and serve over the rice."
      ]
